<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <%- include('./partials/head-seo', { title, seoMeta: (typeof seoMeta !== 'undefined' ? seoMeta : null) }) %>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/store.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include('./partials/header', { hideOnTop: false }) %>

    <main class="contact-page">
      <section class="contact-hero">
        <div class="contact-hero-inner">
          <p class="contact-hero-kicker">SCHREIB UNS</p>
          <h1>Kontakt</h1>
          <span class="contact-hero-divider"></span>
          <p class="contact-hero-lead">
            Fragen zu einem Produkt, deiner Bestellung oder einfach Lust auf ein Gespräch? Wir freuen uns auf deine Nachricht.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section contact-section">
        <div class="contact-grid">
          <aside class="contact-info">
            <h2>So erreichst du uns</h2>
            <p class="contact-info-lead">
              Wir antworten in der Regel innerhalb eines Werktages. Für eilige Anfragen freuen wir uns über eine direkte E-Mail.
            </p>

            <ul class="contact-info-list">
              <li>
                <span class="contact-info-icon"><i class="bi bi-envelope"></i></span>
                <div>
                  <span class="contact-info-label">E-Mail</span>
                  <a class="contact-info-value" href="mailto:shopping@barbae.at">shopping@barbae.at</a>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="contact-info-icon"><i class="bi bi-clock"></i></span>
                <div>
                  <span class="contact-info-label">Erreichbarkeit</span>
                  <span class="contact-info-value">Mo – Fr, 09:00 – 17:00 Uhr</span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="contact-info-icon"><i class="bi bi-truck"></i></span>
                <div>
                  <span class="contact-info-label">Versand &amp; Rückgabe</span>
                  <a class="contact-info-value" href="/versand-rueckgabe">Versandinformationen ansehen</a>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ul>

            <div class="contact-info-note">
              <strong>Tipp:</strong> Für Fragen zu einer bestehenden Bestellung gib bitte deine Bestellnummer an – dann können wir dir schneller helfen.
            </div>
          </aside>

          <div class="contact-form-card">
            <header class="contact-form-head">
              <h2>Nachricht senden</h2>
              <p>Erzähl uns kurz, worum es geht. Felder mit * sind Pflichtfelder.</p>
            </header>

            <% if (error) { %>
              <div class="checkout-error" role="alert"><%= error %></div>
            <% } %>
            <% if (success) { %>
              <div class="checkout-success-note" role="status"><%= success %></div>
            <% } %>

            <form method="post" action="/kontakt" class="contact-form" novalidate>
              <div class="contact-form-grid">
                <label class="contact-field">
                  <span class="contact-field-label">Name <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></span>
                  <input type="text" name="name" required minlength="2" maxlength="120" autocomplete="name" value="<%= form.name || '' %>" />
                </label>
                <label class="contact-field">
                  <span class="contact-field-label">E-Mail <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></span>
                  <input type="email" name="email" required maxlength="190" autocomplete="email" value="<%= form.email || '' %>" />
                </label>
                <label class="contact-field">
                  <span class="contact-field-label">Telefon</span>
                  <input type="tel" name="phone" maxlength="60" autocomplete="tel" value="<%= form.phone || '' %>" />
                </label>
                <label class="contact-field">
                  <span class="contact-field-label">Betreff</span>
                  <input type="text" name="subject" maxlength="190" value="<%= form.subject || '' %>" />
                </label>
              </div>

              <label class="contact-field contact-field-message">
                <span class="contact-field-label">Nachricht <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></span>
                <textarea name="message" rows="7" required minlength="10" maxlength="4000"><%= form.message || '' %></textarea>
              </label>

              <label class="contact-privacy">
                <input type="checkbox" name="privacy" value="1" required />
                <span>
                  Ich habe die <a href="/datenschutz">Datenschutzerklärung</a> gelesen und stimme der Verarbeitung meiner Angaben zur Beantwortung der Anfrage zu.
                </span>
              </label>

              <div class="contact-honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
                <label>Website (bitte freilassen)
                  <input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
                </label>
              </div>

              <button type="submit" class="btn-solid contact-submit">Nachricht senden</button>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <%- include('./partials/seo-bottom', { seoBottom: (typeof seoBottom !== 'undefined' ? seoBottom : null) }) %>
    </main>

    <%- include('./partials/footer') %>
    <script>
      window.__STORE_DATA__ = {
        searchItems: <%- JSON.stringify(searchItems).replace(/</g, '\\u003c') %>,
        initialQuery: ""
      };
    </script>
    <script src="/js/store.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
